   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rules\n- Controller: no business logic. Maps request / response and status codes.\n- Service: owns the transaction and runs the whole transfer flow.\n- Repository: queries only. No business rules, never begins or commits a transaction.\n- Domain: rules and state transitions. No queries.\n- Dependencies point one way: Controller -> Service -> Repository -> DB. Every layer uses Domain.",
   "originalText": "Rules\n- Controller: no business logic. Maps request / response and status codes.\n- Service: owns the transaction and runs the whole transfer flow.\n- Repository: queries only. No business rules, never begins or commits a transaction.\n- Domain: rules and state transitions. No queries.\n- Dependencies point one way: Controller -> Service -> Repository -> DB. Every layer uses Domain.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
